{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>באשר</b>. In every place where the king's word is, there his authority is over you, and there is none who can reprove him to deliver you from his hand, for all will fear him. If so, for flesh and blood — all the more so for the King of truth, whose glory fills above and below."], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:28:21.405100322Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}